  "articleBody": "Before requesting a primary bathroom remodeling proposal, document the room’s measurements, plumbing locations, electrical needs, storage problems, accessibility goals, preferred fixtures, and finish priorities. A clear brief helps the design-build team evaluate the existing space, develop an appropriate layout, identify approval needs, and price the intended scope more accurately.",
